{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_157_1000_null", "source_sha256": "3081715a7ab3f7550973d10f6272f5a1a5f7de18c4e4300a531631f1e3d704e0", "ja": "数日前……", "zh": "几天前……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_157_1001_p", "source_sha256": "5fce7949185f0dcfe9f3989fab4ed30cd2c05226cedbe6e88a2ebc589210ffb6", "ja": "（海美達に、子ども向け教育番組の出演依頼があった。\n今回は海美の新曲を、体操に使ってもらう予定だ）", "zh": "（几天前……\n海美她们接到了出演儿童教育节目的邀请。\n这次准备让海美的新歌用作体操音乐）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_157_1002_029umi", "source_sha256": "cc6f03a4684c74eee5044cc21003208897aadda441636bc76594817d81238c68", "ja": "みんなー！　今日は私たちが、体操のお姉さんだよ！\n一緒に、楽しく、元気よく踊ろうねっ☆", "zh": "小朋友们——！今天我们就是体操大姐姐哦！\n大家一起开开心心、精神饱满地跳起来吧☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_157_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "24702f5aa1f9ccfe61451eff4062fb4980fe8b26fd0ed80c3f72e2dc559a8c71", "ja": "今かかってる曲は、『美！美！美！ビルドUP!!』！\nこの曲に合わせて、『美ルドアップ体操』するよーっ！", "zh": "现在播放的歌曲是《美！美！美！Build UP!!》！\n要跟着这首歌做《美丽升级体操》啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_157_1004_kodomo1", "source_sha256": "0fab643a80c8e76ac5c23f2e6c01ef17774a20c1a05522adbe736a46f059ad63", "ja": "何これ！　おもしろい曲ー！", "zh": "这是什么！好有意思的歌——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_157_1005_kodomo2", "source_sha256": "42f8d9c0c102b4f117e713e3da5be2162a065a3d06466264be84121292e2bec7", "ja": "この曲で、たいそうするの？\n楽しそう！", "zh": "要跟着这首歌做操吗？\n看起来很开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_157_1006_kodomo3", "source_sha256": "129b1f856295f04d67e0cabc1ec287b5d0c4573b13f0ce243d17ed434b6c484e", "ja": "お姉さん、教えて！\nはやくはやくー！", "zh": "姐姐，告诉我嘛！\n快点快点——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_157_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "445fb76b6db536a340f1272b31eb656f2a271b3b724710c72785022d3cf2342b", "ja": "わっ……すごい、みんな元気だね！\nそれじゃ、今から振り付けを一緒に……。", "zh": "哇……好厉害，大家都好有精神呢！\n那我们现在就一起把舞蹈动作给……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_157_1008_kodomo4", "source_sha256": "d56d0741b966bb67573b16242be52abafd0a76d43d1245f186fa8bdd6972c5ac", "ja": "ねえねえ、鬼ゴッコしよ！\n最初は、お姉ちゃんが鬼ね！", "zh": "喂喂，我们来玩捉迷藏吧！\n一开始由姐姐来当鬼哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_157_1009_kodomo5", "source_sha256": "1247a1ea9995a376ebf30b98ef85fd5bd7e32bec552e9b2d02e6fb9f4df00aa4", "ja": "にげろー！！", "zh": "快逃啊——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_157_1010_049mom", "source_sha256": "965df405660eb287e63182ab5a2801dab2883d077f6b525c40c8cc9e9a3856bf", "ja": "お、鬼ゴッコ？　もう、今からみんなで\n体操をするんだから、そんなことしてる場合じゃ……！", "zh": "哦，玩鬼抓人？真是的，我们马上就要一起做体操了，现在可不是做这种事的时候……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_157_1011_029umi", "source_sha256": "29b6bb820ca79810440a041e5bbb2131c4ad02c2952a7949d57e149e64270783", "ja": "おお～。いいね、鬼ごっこ！\nウォームアップにバッチリだと思うっ！", "zh": "哦～不错嘛，捉鬼游戏！我觉得拿来热身正合适！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_157_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "90573ac15af1aeadef3e03945c07f57e37cd445e99c827efb7e7fa01e60717ee", "ja": "でも、スタジオの中を走るのは危ないから……\nみんなで、床にぺたーんって座っちゃお！", "zh": "但是，在演播室里跑来跑去很危险……\n所以大家一起啪嗒一声坐到地上吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_157_1013_kodomo1", "source_sha256": "a6516b28e71983676e3fd2c99c6e4f1cdb208af828260b6570cc3b979aa92c51", "ja": "……？\n鬼ゴッコなのに、すわるの？", "zh": "……？\n明明是在捉迷藏，却要坐下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_157_1014_029umi", "source_sha256": "134f27b83a303f7e4765ada4f371c77acfd832306584719c0ee7b125aa4a0f76", "ja": "そう！　みんな、立っちゃダメだよ？\n座ったままでする鬼ゴッコなんだから☆", "zh": "没错！大家不可以站起来哦？\n这是要坐着玩的鬼抓人游戏嘛☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_157_1015_029umi", "source_sha256": "c7c376846b618a336e3412fc2361cd92904217686f88528cae6abd4b0f8605ae", "ja": "ほらほら、琴葉、ももちん！　真美とモガミンも♪\n一緒に鬼ゴッコするよーっ！", "zh": "快快，琴叶、桃子！真美和最上也一起来♪\n我们一起玩鬼抓人——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_157_1016_017kth", "source_sha256": "493ab1caf631ba4554e5d9eaac016f599c9927dcf13369fffc542c59630a9247", "ja": "わ、わかった！　やってみるね！", "zh": "我、我知道了！我试试看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_157_1017_049mom", "source_sha256": "97122050414076c72f8f9a29aaba18e4808ccf93b470fe516d26907f05d0e351", "ja": "もう、どうして桃子までこんなこと……。", "zh": "真是的，为什么连桃子也要做这种事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_157_1018_015siz", "source_sha256": "ae42baf22ea9ba8f823572d4254566f51213962eb30c86fe24d78681682510dc", "ja": "けど海美さん、座ったまま鬼ゴッコって、\nどうするんですか？", "zh": "不过海美小姐，坐着玩捉迷藏，要怎么玩啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_157_1019_029umi", "source_sha256": "8f78f53893e5974bfbb9398cd81b5f605235d6e79f0f1626225a05e92267faea", "ja": "もちろん、こうやって座ったまま動くんだよー。\nほらっ！", "zh": "当然是像这样坐着移动啦——\n你看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_157_1020_012mam", "source_sha256": "955feebff921af2284340418e26958e01e1f94f4dc44c1573dc44d26619207ef", "ja": "うえっ、速っ！！？\nさすがうみみん、スポーツ万能……！", "zh": "呜哇，好快！！？\n不愧是海美，运动万能……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_157_1021_029umi", "source_sha256": "9cacb3b34e3e04c51876e74331680467ee29e9e9baf0360bbf1936f7ee1da2da", "ja": "えへへ、そうかな？\n琴葉、ももちん、ふたりもやってみて！", "zh": "嘿嘿，是这样吗？\n琴叶、桃子，你们两个也来试试！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_157_1022_017kth", "source_sha256": "def266ba507c093deb745575d40b232ae7c5eb611685109e09b8f2bd7c2c3fe1", "ja": "えっと……あれ？\nこれ、意外と難しい。それに、負荷が大きい？", "zh": "那个……咦？\n这个意外地难。而且，负担也很大？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_157_1023_049mom", "source_sha256": "aafb15328248c3bf6f58543dc35010e7ba28b767e788d186b4473cf49b4b37c0", "ja": "あ、ほんとだ。けっこう難しい……。", "zh": "啊，真的呢。还挺难的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_157_1024_029umi", "source_sha256": "79752ee699c967d2007fc02e39210245a8bf0f9145b59c90628bce5fd82c1a7a", "ja": "でしょでしょ！　でもふたりとも、\n初めてにしては、上手くできてると思う！", "zh": "对吧对吧！不过你们两个，\n作为第一次尝试，我觉得已经做得很棒了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_157_1025_029umi", "source_sha256": "6497ded7121a2f7d38267cd767334ece15352372a3ffab8feaf5a5db9a860c3c", "ja": "それじゃあ、私が鬼ね！　全員捕まえちゃうぞー！\nうりゃうりゃうりゃーーーっ☆", "zh": "那我来当鬼吧！把你们全都抓住——！\n嘿呀嘿呀嘿呀——！☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_157_1026_kodomo4", "source_sha256": "caefea091bc38ce4d72a37cf824b76b25891d5dd878814f0d47b008486a28ac6", "ja": "すげー！？\nお姉ちゃん、めっちゃはやい！", "zh": "好厉害！？\n姐姐，你也太快了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_157_1027_kodomo3", "source_sha256": "fb2502b3d3fde76ca156c42a455f23334d836deac3fff65aa8b12bc32343f225", "ja": "お姉さん、こっちだよこっち！", "zh": "姐姐，这边这边！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_157_1028_015siz", "source_sha256": "68276312ed73685d0b1d4f2fec5947993f055ba3cba7c03ef88a57921dba46ca", "ja": "すごい……。\n海美さん、子どもに大受けしてる……。", "zh": "好厉害……\n海美小姐，完全成了孩子们的最爱……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_157_1029_012mam", "source_sha256": "7f767c3c717b516c0cdf0639321f0a1b29a8ce1fbaf6265f3bae8b580d26f8b3", "ja": "うみみん、完全に場の空気を支配してますなー。\nJKであれだけ子どもと遊べるの、最早才能では……？", "zh": "海美完全掌控全场了呀——\n明明是女高中生，却能和孩子们玩得那么好，这已经算是天赋了吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_157_1030_p", "source_sha256": "ef43fc67e58bd7e0777c8cc9dda76b11012caa7120881440b40f6874b1262071", "ja": "海美の性格が、今回はかなりいい方向に作用してる\nみたいだな。うん、素晴らしい事だ！", "zh": "海美的性格这次似乎发挥了很积极的作用。嗯，真是件好事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_157_1031_012mam", "source_sha256": "d037e3c05ac2bf123362a9299738f3d19ac09776316bf369e3e56886d3d57c5e", "ja": "だが目立つことに関しては、真美たちも\n負けてられないよ～！　行くよ、静香お姉ちゃん！", "zh": "不过说到引人注目，真美我们也不能输哦～！走吧，静香姐姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_157_1032_015siz", "source_sha256": "81f3059ac6a0fee0ace748019900d163df1ad40f9c554c6671b2520cfae82f02", "ja": "え？　そ、そうね！\n私も、がんばらなくちゃ……！", "zh": "诶？对、对啊！\n我也得加油才行……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_157_1033_p", "source_sha256": "d28e5c9ac4f1c001803507becbb2bc52871ccff72a34e5cfba95b922ec64bdeb", "ja": "（子どもがたくさんいる現場は、テンション維持が\n大変だけど。今回は心配なさそうかな……ん？）", "zh": "（现场有这么多孩子，维持他们的兴致虽然很不容易。不过这次应该不用担心了吧……嗯？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_157_1035_p", "source_sha256": "c9995fa887d6d191d5c0eef37884e751caabfc6a975a174385ae76154571c203", "ja": "（端にいるあの男の子、鬼ごっこに参加してないな。\n……体調不良、というわけでもなさそうだけど……）", "zh": "（在边上的那个男孩子，没参加捉鬼游戏啊。\n……但看起来也不像是身体不舒服……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
